<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers or heifers were slow, prices were steady.</p>
<p>Steers - bulk of supply select and choice 2-4, frequently muddy 1100-1325 lbs 65.00-66.50; some cleaner mostly choice 66.50- 67.75. Select 63.00-65.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to mostly choice 2-4 950-1250 lbs 65.00- 67.50, not many above 66.00 but not many clean either. Select 63.00- 65.00.</p>
</text>
